[{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0861","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0861.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-59896","title":"Hono JSX 服务端渲染跨请求上下文数据泄露漏洞","description":"Hono 框架的 JSX 服务端渲染组件（hono/jsx）存在上下文隔离缺陷（CWE-362），在异步组件执行 `await` 挂起期间，上下文值存储于进程级全局结构而非请求级作用域，导致并发请求可相互读取或覆盖 `createContext`/`useContext`/`jsxRenderer`/`useRequestContext` 提供的上下文数据。攻击者无需认证即可利用该竞态条件漏洞，在并发请求场景下获取其他用户的渲染输出或绕过基于上下文的授权检查，造成敏感信息泄露与权限验证错乱。该漏洞影响 Hono 4.11.8 至 4.12.27 版本，已在 4.12.27 版本中修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-59896","GHSA-hvrm-45r6-mjfj"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-08T17:17:27Z","updated":"2026-07-10T19:50:53Z","remediation":"立即将 hono 升级至 v4.12.27 或以上版本（npm install hono@4.12.27）。如无法立即升级，避免在异步组件中在 await 之后读取 useContext() 或 useRequestContext() 的值，或将所有上下文读取操作移至 await 之前执行以降低风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/honojs/hono/commit/fab3b13639339cbd5ba1166a5b23d9ac30c5f64f","https://github.com/honojs/hono/releases/tag/v4.12.27","https://github.com/honojs/hono/security/advisories/GHSA-hvrm-45r6-mjfj","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a31aa101497b2d23391e84ef31f75e6600381dae/cves/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59896.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/bbff37eeafd64310b94d439a5f7493406fcdc115/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59896.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be7c9eef0523e112dce5fde0006bf85d14a40618/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-59896.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be7c9eef0523e112dce5fde0006bf85d14a40618/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-59896.json","https://github.com/prowler-cloud/prowler/blob/e15f6970eff8c7245616a46c0cdcd18b4a7fff83/ui/CHANGELOG.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2026-59896.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/db96a5d12e1a4bc3df59241db4f4f41371d4bdc0/npm/hono/CVE-2026-59896.yml","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b6c80ad7b47e52f64ae2ee2b20e56d7eaaaa57fe/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-598xx/CVE-2026-59896.json","https://github.com/prowler-cloud/prowler/blob/e15f6970eff8c7245616a46c0cdcd18b4a7fff83/docs/changelog.mdx","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/7b01787ec7e75af915759c46f6ffd5276c9f9f37/content/posts/cve-2026-59896.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0861.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0860","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0860.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-59895","title":"Hono cx() 服务端跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Hono Web 应用框架的 css 模块中 cx() 函数存在 JSX 转义绕过漏洞。该函数将组合后的类名字符串标记为已转义状态，但未对输入进行 HTML 转义处理。当服务端渲染 JSX 时，攻击者可通过在 className 中注入未转义的特殊字符（如双引号）突破 class 属性边界，插入任意 HTML 标签和脚本，导致跨站脚本攻击。该漏洞影响 Hono 4.0.0 至 4.12.27 版本，攻击者无需认证，远程利用但需用户交互触发。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2026-59895","GHSA-w62v-xxxg-mg59"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-08T17:17:27Z","updated":"2026-07-10T19:53:22Z","remediation":"立即将 Hono 升级至 v4.12.27 或以上版本（npm install hono@^4.12.27）。升级后，cx() 函数会对输入进行 HTML 转义，防止 className 中的特殊字符突破 class 属性边界。如无法立即升级，避免将用户可控的输入直接传递给 cx() 函数，或在服务端渲染前对 className 参数进行严格的 HTML 实体编码（如将 \" 转义为 &quot;）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/honojs/hono/commit/cd3f6f7194f0e5c9d4b26ae0cf232018d0f388fc","https://github.com/honojs/hono/releases/tag/v4.12.27","https://github.com/honojs/hono/security/advisories/GHSA-w62v-xxxg-mg59","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a31aa101497b2d23391e84ef31f75e6600381dae/cves/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59895.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/bbff37eeafd64310b94d439a5f7493406fcdc115/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59895.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be7c9eef0523e112dce5fde0006bf85d14a40618/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-59895.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be7c9eef0523e112dce5fde0006bf85d14a40618/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-59895.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2026-59895.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/db96a5d12e1a4bc3df59241db4f4f41371d4bdc0/npm/hono/CVE-2026-59895.yml","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b6c80ad7b47e52f64ae2ee2b20e56d7eaaaa57fe/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-598xx/CVE-2026-59895.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/7b01787ec7e75af915759c46f6ffd5276c9f9f37/content/posts/cve-2026-59895.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/b5100979f8c44200a9b65976c3ddceb21c01ae6d/2026/CVE-2026-59895.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/2ea9851780633b2caab16fe048a14b38ca9a0b56/content/CVE-2026-59895.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0860.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0859","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0859.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-59892","title":"OpenTelemetry JavaScript JaegerPropagator 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"OpenTelemetry JavaScript 的 `@opentelemetry/propagator-jaeger` 组件中存在拒绝服务漏洞。`JaegerPropagator.extract()` 方法在解码 HTTP 请求头 `uber-trace-id` 和 `uberctx-*` 时调用 `decodeURIComponent()` 但未处理解码异常，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过发送包含畸形百分号编码值（如裸 `%`）的 HTTP 请求触发未捕获的 `URIError`，导致使用 `JaegerPropagator` 作为全局传播器的 Node.js 进程崩溃退出，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响所有启用了 Jaeger 传播器的 OpenTelemetry JavaScript 应用，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。官方已在 `@opentelemetry/propagator-jaeger` 2.9.0 版本中修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-59892","GHSA-45rx-2jwx-cxfr"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-08T17:17:27Z","updated":"2026-07-10T18:56:03Z","remediation":"将 @opentelemetry/propagator-jaeger 升级至 2.9.0 或更高版本，该版本已忽略无法解码的标头值而非抛出异常。如无法立即升级，可在反向代理（如 nginx、Envoy）或 API 网关层过滤并剥离入站请求中的 uber-trace-id 和 uberctx-* 标头，仅允许受信任的上游服务传递这些标头。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-js/commit/b1c196d49d54caae59741cca0a9d57d101d7ea88","https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-js/releases/tag/v2.9.0","https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-js/security/advisories/GHSA-45rx-2jwx-cxfr","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/27584df20575115093a915d82c76b5107dd9d51e/cves/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59892.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/bbff37eeafd64310b94d439a5f7493406fcdc115/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59892.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be7c9eef0523e112dce5fde0006bf85d14a40618/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-59892.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be7c9eef0523e112dce5fde0006bf85d14a40618/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-59892.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/35f8822ad3b850cb8a922d9066b0d79c83dab6d5/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-59892.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2026-59892.json","https://github.com/NVIDIA/NemoClaw/blob/d6ac4027b75b15b8acd1456984acbbfb623cb231/docs/security/advisory-early-warning.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b6c80ad7b47e52f64ae2ee2b20e56d7eaaaa57fe/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-598xx/CVE-2026-59892.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/83e06f4dc8d4c981660063007f8931d97353357a/2026/CVE-2026-59892.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/77c1c4e2b164ba912ebd6005200ea105caf493c9/reports/2026-07-08/TIER_3_CVE-2026-59892.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0859.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0859.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0859.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0857","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0857.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-59890","title":"PyPA setuptools MANIFEST.in Unicode 规范化绕过漏洞","description":"setuptools 的 FileList 组件在处理 MANIFEST.in 排除规则时，未对文件名和匹配模式进行 Unicode 规范化处理，导致在 macOS APFS/HFS+ 等保留 Unicode 编码形式的文件系统上，以 NFC 编码写入的排除规则无法匹配以 NFD 编码存储的同名字文件。攻击者可在受影响的 Python 项目中放置一个 NFD 编码的敏感文件（如密钥、配置文件），当维护者在 macOS 上构建源码分发包（sdist）时，该文件会绕过 MANIFEST.in 的排除指令被打包进 .tar.gz 并发布到 PyPI，造成敏感信息不可逆泄露。该漏洞影响 setuptools 83.0.0 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 6.1，攻击者需诱导维护者构建包含恶意文件的项目，利用条件为文件系统支持 Unicode 编码形式保留且文件名包含非 ASCII 字符。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2026-59890","GHSA-h35f-9h28-mq5c"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-08T17:17:27Z","updated":"2026-07-13T17:04:58Z","remediation":"立即升级 setuptools 至 83.0.0 或更高版本（`pip install --upgrade setuptools`）。如无法升级，在 macOS 上构建 sdist 前将所有非 ASCII 文件名统一为 NFC 格式（`python -c \"import unicodedata, os; [os.rename(f, unicodedata.normalize('NFC', f)) for f in os.listdir('.') if unicodedata.normalize('NFC', f) != f]\"`），并在 CI 中增加 Unicode 规范化检查步骤。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/pypa/setuptools/commit/dd9f436a36486b4cb8a4c70a2321548b0be09b8f","https://github.com/pypa/setuptools/releases/tag/v83.0.0","https://github.com/pypa/setuptools/security/advisories/GHSA-h35f-9h28-mq5c","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/27584df20575115093a915d82c76b5107dd9d51e/cves/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59890.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/bbff37eeafd64310b94d439a5f7493406fcdc115/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59890.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c31c0a9b9af147bd58078ebf7769418f19d3f2e1/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-59890.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c31c0a9b9af147bd58078ebf7769418f19d3f2e1/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-59890.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/35f8822ad3b850cb8a922d9066b0d79c83dab6d5/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-59890.md","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/753d2e0d725b348a212e8863d776d632b54550eb/data/2026/CVE-2026-59890.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/ae03a9d5bcdec0092d3f179316a97b5f3dabc853/vex/cve/2026/CVE-2026-59890.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/ae03a9d5bcdec0092d3f179316a97b5f3dabc853/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-59890.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2026-59890.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b6c80ad7b47e52f64ae2ee2b20e56d7eaaaa57fe/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-598xx/CVE-2026-59890.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0857.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0854","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0854.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-59887","title":"linkify-it mailto验证器二次复杂度拒绝服务漏洞","description":"linkify-it 是一个支持完整 Unicode 的链接识别库，其 `mailto:` 模式验证器存在二次复杂度拒绝服务漏洞。当 `.test()` 或 `.match()` 方法处理用户输入时，每遇到一个 `mailto:` 就会执行 `text.slice(pos)`（O(n) 复制）并通过贪婪正则 `src_email_name` 扫描整个剩余文本（O(n)），导致 N 次 `mailto:` 触发 N × O(n) = O(n²) 的 CPU 消耗。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过提交特制的短文本（如约 336KB 的 `mailto:` 重复字符串）阻塞单线程事件循环数秒，影响基于 markdown-it 并启用 linkify 的评论系统、聊天、论坛、Wiki 等应用。该漏洞影响 linkify-it 5.0.2 之前的所有版本，已在 5.0.2 中修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-59887","GHSA-v245-v573-v5vm"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-08T17:17:26Z","updated":"2026-07-10T19:13:03Z","remediation":"立即将 linkify-it 升级至 5.0.2 或以上版本（npm install linkify-it@^5.0.2），该版本已限制 email 本地部分长度并改用 sticky 正则避免全尾扫描。如无法升级，可在调用 .test()/.match() 前对输入文本做长度限制（建议 ≤50KB），或在 markdown-it 中关闭 linkify 功能（{linkify:false}）作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/markdown-it/linkify-it/commit/105e5d77f7d119871d2b2d86ed208568eb3e7ffe","https://github.com/markdown-it/linkify-it/releases/tag/5.0.2","https://github.com/markdown-it/linkify-it/security/advisories/GHSA-v245-v573-v5vm","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2026/CVE-2026-59887.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/27584df20575115093a915d82c76b5107dd9d51e/cves/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59887.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/0fed28f73afbb5eb38c05b167f63ae6a3a91eb60/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59887.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c31c0a9b9af147bd58078ebf7769418f19d3f2e1/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-59887.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c31c0a9b9af147bd58078ebf7769418f19d3f2e1/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-59887.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/35f8822ad3b850cb8a922d9066b0d79c83dab6d5/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-59887.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2026-59887.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b6c80ad7b47e52f64ae2ee2b20e56d7eaaaa57fe/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-598xx/CVE-2026-59887.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/db96a5d12e1a4bc3df59241db4f4f41371d4bdc0/npm/linkify-it/CVE-2026-59887.yml","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/77c1c4e2b164ba912ebd6005200ea105caf493c9/reports/2026-07-08/TIER_3_CVE-2026-59887.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0854.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0854.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0854.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0850","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0850.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-59883","title":"Guzzle PHP HTTP 客户端 Cookie 跨主机泄露与注入漏洞","description":"Guzzle（PHP HTTP 客户端）的 CookieJar 组件在处理 Cookie 的 Domain 属性时存在安全缺陷。当 Cookie 的 Domain 被设置为 IPv4 字面量（如 `192.168.0.1`）、IPv6 字面量（如 `[::1]`）或裸数值（如 `1` 表示 `0.0.0.1`）时，`SetCookie::matchesDomain()` 错误地对其应用了子域名后缀匹配规则而非精确主机匹配，导致作用域为 IP 地址的 Cookie 会被发送到名称以该 IP 值为后缀的任意主机（如 `evil.192.168.0.1`）。攻击者可通过控制 DNS 解析或在内网/容器/开发环境中诱导用户访问仿冒主机，实现跨主机 Cookie 泄露、Cookie 注入或会话固定攻击。该漏洞影响 Guzzle 7.12.3 之前的所有版本，已在 7.12.3 版本中修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.7,"aliases":["CVE-2026-59883","GHSA-g446-98w2-8p5w"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-08T17:17:26Z","updated":"2026-07-13T14:01:39Z","remediation":"立即将 guzzlehttp/guzzle 升级至 7.12.3 或更高版本（composer require guzzlehttp/guzzle ^7.12.3）。如无法升级，避免在不同信任级别的主机间复用同一 CookieJar 实例，为每个主机或信任边界使用独立的 CookieJar，或对不可信主机的请求禁用 Cookie 处理（不设置 `cookies => true`），同时避免将 Cookie 的 Domain 属性设为 IP 地址或裸数字值。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/guzzle/guzzle/commit/b9944c161b12d9ee9c9334cfc5b9659ecd7451f8","https://github.com/guzzle/guzzle/pull/3694","https://github.com/guzzle/guzzle/releases/tag/7.12.3","https://github.com/guzzle/guzzle/security/advisories/GHSA-g446-98w2-8p5w","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b37ddadc32d456372cb07846a95b411ce7a32d9f/cves/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59883.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/0fed28f73afbb5eb38c05b167f63ae6a3a91eb60/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59883.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c31c0a9b9af147bd58078ebf7769418f19d3f2e1/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-59883.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c31c0a9b9af147bd58078ebf7769418f19d3f2e1/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-59883.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/753d2e0d725b348a212e8863d776d632b54550eb/data/2026/CVE-2026-59883.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/ae03a9d5bcdec0092d3f179316a97b5f3dabc853/vex/cve/2026/CVE-2026-59883.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/ae03a9d5bcdec0092d3f179316a97b5f3dabc853/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-59883.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2026-59883.json","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/27a74eedb9de5512b284a88a513f48696206fede/data/anchore/2026/CVE-2026-59883.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b6c80ad7b47e52f64ae2ee2b20e56d7eaaaa57fe/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-598xx/CVE-2026-59883.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0850.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0849","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0849.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-59882","title":"guzzlehttp psr7 主机验证绕过漏洞","description":"guzzlehttp/psr7 是一个 PHP PSR-7 HTTP 消息库实现。在 2.12.3 版本之前，Uri::assertValidHost() 方法未能正确拒绝包含权限分隔符（/、?、#、@、\\）、内嵌端口（如 host:8080）或格式错误的 IPv6 括号（如 [::1 或 ::1]）的 URI 主机组件，导致 Uri::getHost() 返回的值与 URI 的实际权限部分不一致。攻击者若能够控制部分或全部主机输入，可利用此缺陷构造特制 URI 绕过主机白名单/黑名单检查、SSRF 防护、Cookie 作用域或代理绕过决策，造成基于主机的访问控制绕过、服务端请求伪造或 Host 头混淆攻击。该漏洞影响 guzzlehttp/psr7 及依赖其的 guzzlehttp/guzzle 库，已在 2.12.3 版本中修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.2,"aliases":["CVE-2026-59882","GHSA-c2w2-prh8-qm98"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-08T17:17:26Z","updated":"2026-07-17T14:29:51Z","remediation":"立即将 guzzlehttp/psr7 升级至 2.12.3 或更高版本（composer require guzzlehttp/psr7:^2.12.3）。如无法立即升级，在将不可信主机输入传入 Uri 构造函数或 withHost() 前，手动校验并过滤含 / ? # @ \\ 冒号或括号不匹配的主机值，且勿将 getHost() 返回值直接用于安全决策。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/guzzle/psr7/commit/ddd64f17d4cc1f7e5ffe6fd2c989ec7221712580","https://github.com/guzzle/psr7/pull/811","https://github.com/guzzle/psr7/releases/tag/2.12.3","https://github.com/guzzle/psr7/security/advisories/GHSA-c2w2-prh8-qm98","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b37ddadc32d456372cb07846a95b411ce7a32d9f/cves/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59882.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/0fed28f73afbb5eb38c05b167f63ae6a3a91eb60/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59882.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c31c0a9b9af147bd58078ebf7769418f19d3f2e1/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-59882.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c31c0a9b9af147bd58078ebf7769418f19d3f2e1/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-59882.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/753d2e0d725b348a212e8863d776d632b54550eb/data/2026/CVE-2026-59882.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/ae03a9d5bcdec0092d3f179316a97b5f3dabc853/vex/cve/2026/CVE-2026-59882.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/ae03a9d5bcdec0092d3f179316a97b5f3dabc853/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-59882.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2026-59882.json","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/27a74eedb9de5512b284a88a513f48696206fede/data/anchore/2026/CVE-2026-59882.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b6c80ad7b47e52f64ae2ee2b20e56d7eaaaa57fe/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-598xx/CVE-2026-59882.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0849.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0847","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0847.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-59879","title":"Immutable.js List 32位trie溢出拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Immutable.js 的 List 数据结构在 setListBounds() 方法中存在 32 位有符号整数溢出漏洞。当传入索引或大小处于 [2³⁰, 2³¹) 范围时，位运算 `1 << exp` 因 JavaScript 移位操作符对 32 取模而溢出为负值，导致空 List 进入不可捕获的无限循环（CPU 100% 占用，进程无法恢复），或已填充 List 无限制分配内存直至进程因 OOM 被系统终止（SIGABRT/exit 134）。此外，`setSize` 方法中 `|= 0` 的 ToInt32 强制转换导致大数值静默回绕，造成数据状态静默损坏。攻击者无需认证，仅需通过 HTTP 请求体、URL 参数或 JSON-Patch 端点传入恶意索引值（如 `1073741824`）即可触发，影响所有使用 `fromJS` 配合 `setIn`/`updateIn` 处理不可信输入的应用场景。该漏洞影响 immutable.js 4.3.9 之前和 5.1.8 之前的版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.7,"aliases":["CVE-2026-59879","GHSA-v56q-mh7h-f735"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-08T17:17:26Z","updated":"2026-07-10T18:48:54Z","remediation":"立即升级 immutable.js 至 v4.3.9 或 v5.1.8 及以上版本。如无法升级，在调用 set/setIn/updateIn 前对外部传入的 List 索引或 key-path 数值段做上限校验，拒绝 ≥1073741824 (2^30) 的数值；同时将请求处理逻辑放入独立 worker 进程并设置 --max-old-space-size 堆上限，防止单请求导致主进程崩溃。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/immutable-js/immutable-js/commit/a1a1ee412dcaa380ab325196283d06594ffe4b84","https://github.com/immutable-js/immutable-js/commit/f0bc997d8eb9886aff2236635aa210a95a04304a","https://github.com/immutable-js/immutable-js/releases/tag/v4.3.9","https://github.com/immutable-js/immutable-js/releases/tag/v5.1.8","https://github.com/immutable-js/immutable-js/security/advisories/GHSA-v56q-mh7h-f735","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b37ddadc32d456372cb07846a95b411ce7a32d9f/cves/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59879.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/380f533205c12eeaa5a8c27e3ae790586a72a402/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59879.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37be0559d0574b93d433d6c01d9f77ea4c420519/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-59879.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/ae03a9d5bcdec0092d3f179316a97b5f3dabc853/vex/cve/2026/CVE-2026-59879.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/ae03a9d5bcdec0092d3f179316a97b5f3dabc853/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-59879.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37be0559d0574b93d433d6c01d9f77ea4c420519/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-59879.json","https://github.com/dbeaver/cloudbeaver/blob/57cc6e4808f0bf58bb1553cd2764f4fe75b44826/README.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/db96a5d12e1a4bc3df59241db4f4f41371d4bdc0/npm/immutable/CVE-2026-59879.yml","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/2880bce38b1c3fec315752297be30e3d60dabff9/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2026-59879","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2026-59879.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0847.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0834","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0834.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-59731","title":"Astro URL路径规范化不匹配授权绕过漏洞","description":"Astro 6.4.7 版本存在授权绕过漏洞，源于迭代 URL 解码器最大解码深度限制（10 次）与路由重写路径规范化不一致。当攻击者构造编码深度超过 11 层的特制 URL（如 /%252525252525252525252561dmin）时，中间件授权检查仅获得部分解码路径（/%61dmin），而后续路由匹配执行额外的 decodeURI() 操作后解析为受保护路径（/admin），导致绕过中间件权限校验。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可利用此漏洞访问受保护的 /admin、/api/admin、/internal 等路由，造成敏感信息泄露和未授权操作。该漏洞影响 Astro 6.4.7 版本，CVSS 评分 8.2，危害等级高。官方已在 6.4.8 版本中修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.2,"aliases":["CVE-2026-59731","GHSA-vj59-8hwv-xxmv"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-08T17:17:25Z","updated":"2026-07-09T16:29:14Z","remediation":"立即将 Astro 升级至 6.4.8 或更高版本（该版本在解码迭代达到上限时抛出错误而非返回部分解码路径）。如无法立即升级，可在反向代理或 WAF 层面添加规则，拒绝包含超过 10 层 URL 编码的请求路径（如匹配 `%25` 重复出现 10 次以上的路径），作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/27c80ea92248993e5fce94b2c26d87d611ab6785","https://github.com/withastro/astro/pull/17109","https://github.com/withastro/astro/releases/tag/astro@6.4.8","https://github.com/withastro/astro/security/advisories/GHSA-vj59-8hwv-xxmv","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8491df4167cab37455be87043bbd4187ade74c40/cves/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59731.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6ff73fb4bb99974a2b535c179f337dd820550366/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59731.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/16f8cf2a3c129bb57f3727599f3730e6001c1186/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-59731.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/16f8cf2a3c129bb57f3727599f3730e6001c1186/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-59731.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/35f8822ad3b850cb8a922d9066b0d79c83dab6d5/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-59731.md","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/753d2e0d725b348a212e8863d776d632b54550eb/data/2026/CVE-2026-59731.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2026-59731.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/7c13974e8672408967145db42c357210cb59d951/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-597xx/CVE-2026-59731.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/db96a5d12e1a4bc3df59241db4f4f41371d4bdc0/npm/astro/CVE-2026-59731.yml","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/27a74eedb9de5512b284a88a513f48696206fede/data/anchore/2026/CVE-2026-59731.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0834.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0848","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0848.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-59880","title":"Immutable.js Immutable.Map/Set 哈希碰撞算法复杂性拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Immutable.js 的 Immutable.Map 和 Immutable.Set 数据结构使用 32 位哈希值进行键值存储，当多个键共享相同哈希值时会被放入 HashCollisionNode 碰撞桶中进行线性扫描。由于字符串哈希算法是公开且确定性的（JVM 风格多项式哈希），攻击者可通过控制插入到 Map 中的键（如通过 Immutable.Map(obj)、Immutable.fromJS(obj) 或 state.merge(userObject) 等方式），构造大量哈希碰撞的键，使插入和查找操作从均摊 O(1) 退化为 O(n)，构建或读取整个集合的时间复杂度达到 O(n²)。在单线程运行时环境（如 Node.js）中，少量精心构造的 payload 即可消耗不成比例的 CPU 资源，导致事件循环阻塞，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Immutable.js 4.x 至 5.1.7 版本，已在 4.3.9 和 5.1.8 版本中修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.7,"aliases":["CVE-2026-59880","GHSA-xvcm-6775-5m9r"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-08T16:16:34Z","updated":"2026-07-10T18:49:51Z","remediation":"立即升级 Immutable.js 至 v4.3.9（4.x 分支）或 v5.1.8（5.x 分支）及以上版本，这两个版本已引入带种子的二次哈希算法解决碰撞问题。如无法立即升级，在将不可信用户输入传入 Immutable.Map(obj)、Immutable.fromJS(obj) 或 state.merge(userObject) 前，应限制请求体大小、对象键数量及键长度，并拒绝高基数 payload 以降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/immutable-js/immutable-js/commit/3dd7e5655012597a41873e328bf9142a8901527b","https://github.com/immutable-js/immutable-js/commit/e51d49fc612ded5ec4dfb94ff294d22074269b0f","https://github.com/immutable-js/immutable-js/releases/tag/v4.3.9","https://github.com/immutable-js/immutable-js/releases/tag/v5.1.8","https://github.com/immutable-js/immutable-js/security/advisories/GHSA-xvcm-6775-5m9r","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2026/CVE-2026-59880.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b37ddadc32d456372cb07846a95b411ce7a32d9f/cves/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59880.json","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/5f7b2444b1b2b1b019b434748bbb88035c2136a4/2026/CVE-2026-59880.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/380f533205c12eeaa5a8c27e3ae790586a72a402/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59880.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37be0559d0574b93d433d6c01d9f77ea4c420519/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-59880.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/35f8822ad3b850cb8a922d9066b0d79c83dab6d5/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-59880.md","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/ae03a9d5bcdec0092d3f179316a97b5f3dabc853/vex/cve/2026/CVE-2026-59880.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/ae03a9d5bcdec0092d3f179316a97b5f3dabc853/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-59880.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37be0559d0574b93d433d6c01d9f77ea4c420519/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-59880.json","https://github.com/dbeaver/cloudbeaver/blob/57cc6e4808f0bf58bb1553cd2764f4fe75b44826/README.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0848.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0848.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0848.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0846","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0846.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-59877","title":"protobufjs .proto 选项解析无限循环拒绝服务漏洞","description":"protobufjs 在解析 .proto 文件中的选项名称时存在无限循环漏洞。该库在解析过程中通过逐个读取 schema token 直到遇到 `=` 号来提取选项名，但未对输入结束进行边界检查。攻击者可以构造一个声明了选项但提前结束的恶意 .proto 文件，通过 `parse`、`Root.load` 或 `Root.loadSync` 等 API 触发解析，导致解析器陷入无限循环。由于 Node.js 采用单线程事件循环模型，该漏洞会造成事件循环阻塞，使进程无法响应任何其他请求，直至被外部终止，从而导致拒绝服务。攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，影响使用 protobufjs 7.6.5 之前版本及 8.6.6 之前版本的应用。建议升级至 7.6.5 或 8.6.6 及以上版本修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.3,"aliases":["CVE-2026-59877","GHSA-j3f2-48v5-ccww"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-08T16:16:34Z","updated":"2026-07-10T18:53:14Z","remediation":"将 protobufjs 升级至 7.6.5 或 8.6.6 及以上版本。如无法立即升级，避免解析来自不可信来源的 .proto 文件；若必须解析，将解析操作隔离到独立子进程或 Worker 线程中并设置超时机制，防止解析卡死阻塞主事件循环。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/protobufjs/protobuf.js/commit/10fba6d54815ceecca8a06b9a6db490c8f5d2217","https://github.com/protobufjs/protobuf.js/commit/fa5c73add738ceb471e74da8cc2f3727c3d0a69f","https://github.com/protobufjs/protobuf.js/pull/2352","https://github.com/protobufjs/protobuf.js/releases/tag/protobufjs-v7.6.5","https://github.com/protobufjs/protobuf.js/releases/tag/protobufjs-v8.6.6","https://github.com/protobufjs/protobuf.js/security/advisories/GHSA-j3f2-48v5-ccww","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b37ddadc32d456372cb07846a95b411ce7a32d9f/cves/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59877.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/380f533205c12eeaa5a8c27e3ae790586a72a402/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59877.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37be0559d0574b93d433d6c01d9f77ea4c420519/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-59877.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37be0559d0574b93d433d6c01d9f77ea4c420519/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-59877.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2026-59877.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/db96a5d12e1a4bc3df59241db4f4f41371d4bdc0/npm/protobufjs/CVE-2026-59877.yml","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/e9b51a58e4ac0e6b00dc38147f459707e98ae056/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-598xx/CVE-2026-59877.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/5d2b90135469e518b8bd9c7142a1d639da966b67/2026/CVE-2026-59877.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/7b01787ec7e75af915759c46f6ffd5276c9f9f37/content/posts/cve-2026-59877.md","https://github.com/podman-desktop/podman-desktop/blob/bb90676eb8a4291fa2e0211417202246ba65ddf4/website/blog/2026-07-30-release-1.29.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0846.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0845","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0845.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-59876","title":"protobufjs protobuf.js 文本格式解析原型污染漏洞","description":"protobufjs 的文本格式扩展在解析字符串键映射条目时使用了普通属性赋值方式，当映射键为 `__proto__` 时，会修改返回映射对象的原型而非创建自有条目，导致原型污染。攻击者可通过向使用 `protobufjs/ext/textformat` 解析不可信文本格式输入的应用程序提供特制输入，实现对象级原型篡改。影响范围包括 protobufjs 8.2.0 至 8.6.5 版本，CVSS 评分 4.8，危害等级中危。修复版本为 8.6.5，建议升级或避免解析不可信的文本格式输入。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-59876","GHSA-jfj6-75fj-8934"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-08T16:16:34Z","updated":"2026-07-13T15:02:37Z","remediation":"立即升级 protobufjs 至 8.6.5 或更高版本：在项目根目录执行 `npm install protobufjs@^8.6.5`。如无法立即升级，禁止解析不可信的 protobuf Text Format 输入，或在解析前过滤掉键名为 `__proto__` 的 map 条目，并在消费解析后的 map 对象时使用 `Object.hasOwnProperty.call(map, key)` 替代直接属性访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/protobufjs/protobuf.js/commit/9f97fe413072d3beb52c74e62d88ea8adc9444d8","https://github.com/protobufjs/protobuf.js/pull/2335","https://github.com/protobufjs/protobuf.js/releases/tag/protobufjs-v8.6.5","https://github.com/protobufjs/protobuf.js/security/advisories/GHSA-jfj6-75fj-8934","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b37ddadc32d456372cb07846a95b411ce7a32d9f/cves/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59876.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/380f533205c12eeaa5a8c27e3ae790586a72a402/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59876.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37be0559d0574b93d433d6c01d9f77ea4c420519/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-59876.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37be0559d0574b93d433d6c01d9f77ea4c420519/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-59876.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/753d2e0d725b348a212e8863d776d632b54550eb/data/2026/CVE-2026-59876.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2026-59876.json","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/27a74eedb9de5512b284a88a513f48696206fede/data/anchore/2026/CVE-2026-59876.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/e9b51a58e4ac0e6b00dc38147f459707e98ae056/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-598xx/CVE-2026-59876.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/db96a5d12e1a4bc3df59241db4f4f41371d4bdc0/npm/protobufjs/CVE-2026-59876.yml","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7597ddfeff03aa9cd00b0ce83a368fad007497d9/2026/CVE-2026-59876.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0845.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0844","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0844.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-59875","title":"node-tar PAX路径记录NUL字节未捕获异常拒绝服务漏洞","description":"node-tar 是一个 Node.js 的 tar 归档操作库。在 7.5.17 版本之前，其 PAX 扩展头部解析函数 `parseKVLine` 未对路径（path）和链接路径（linkpath）字段中的 NUL 字节进行过滤，而 GNU L/K 长头部处理函数已正确实现了该过滤。攻击者可通过构造包含 NUL 字节的 PAX 记录（如 `path=visible.txt\\x00hidden.txt`）的恶意 tar 文件，使 `entry.path` 携带 NUL 字节传入 `fs.lstat()` 或 `fs.open()`，触发 Node.js 核心的 `ERR_INVALID_ARG_VALUE` 异常。该异常在异步回调链中抛出，绕过用户代码的 `try/catch` 捕获，作为未捕获异常（uncaughtException）直接终止进程，造成拒绝服务。远程攻击者无需认证即可利用此漏洞，影响所有通过 `tar.x`/`tar.extract` 解压用户提供 tar 文件的 Node.js 应用，包括 npm 注册表、CI 流水线、容器构建等场景。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.3,"aliases":["CVE-2026-59875","GHSA-gvwx-54wh-qm9j"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-08T16:16:34Z","updated":"2026-07-10T19:10:59Z","remediation":"立即将 node-tar 升级至 7.5.17 或更高版本（npm install tar@^7.5.17）。如无法升级，可在提取 tarball 前使用外部工具（如 GNU tar）预处理过滤含 NUL 字节的路径，或添加全局 uncaughtException 处理器并重启进程作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/isaacs/node-tar/commit/7a635c29f5edbf083557374d43984273ecfed5b3","https://github.com/isaacs/node-tar/releases/tag/v7.5.17","https://github.com/isaacs/node-tar/security/advisories/GHSA-gvwx-54wh-qm9j","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2026/CVE-2026-59875.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b37ddadc32d456372cb07846a95b411ce7a32d9f/cves/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59875.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/380f533205c12eeaa5a8c27e3ae790586a72a402/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59875.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37be0559d0574b93d433d6c01d9f77ea4c420519/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-59875.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37be0559d0574b93d433d6c01d9f77ea4c420519/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-59875.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/35f8822ad3b850cb8a922d9066b0d79c83dab6d5/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-59875.md","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/753d2e0d725b348a212e8863d776d632b54550eb/data/2026/CVE-2026-59875.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/ae03a9d5bcdec0092d3f179316a97b5f3dabc853/vex/cve/2026/CVE-2026-59875.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/ae03a9d5bcdec0092d3f179316a97b5f3dabc853/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-59875.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2026-59875.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0844.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0843","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0843.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-59874","title":"node-tar tar 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"node-tar 是 Node.js 生态中广泛使用的 tar 归档文件操作库。在 7.5.18 之前的版本中，其 tar.replace() 接口在扫描现有归档文件时，会解析每个 tar 文件头的条目大小字段。攻击者可以构造一个校验和合法的 tar 文件头，将条目大小编码为负值（如 -512），导致扫描器在计算下一个条目的偏移量时出现错误，使得扫描位置无法前进，反复解析同一个文件头，陷入无限循环。调用 tar.replace() 处理攻击者可控的 tar 归档文件时，工作进程将被永久挂起，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞无需身份认证，远程攻击者通过网络即可触发，影响所有使用 node-tar 且调用 replace 接口的 Node.js 应用。建议升级至 7.5.18 或更高版本修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.7,"aliases":["CVE-2026-59874","GHSA-8x88-c5mf-7j5w"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-08T16:16:33Z","updated":"2026-07-10T18:54:12Z","remediation":"立即将 node-tar 升级至 7.5.18 或更高版本（`npm install tar@^7.5.18`）。如无法升级，避免对不可信的 tar 存档调用 `tar.replace()` API，改用 `tar.extract()` 等不受影响的接口，并在调用前对存档进行校验。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/isaacs/node-tar/commit/9e78bf058b2c22dd4d52e00d8922d5c06fc2f7b5","https://github.com/isaacs/node-tar/releases/tag/v7.5.18","https://github.com/isaacs/node-tar/security/advisories/GHSA-8x88-c5mf-7j5w","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2026/CVE-2026-59874.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a14f4e66db68a75a9270d6c9081e9ffb7f931cd8/cves/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59874.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/380f533205c12eeaa5a8c27e3ae790586a72a402/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59874.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37be0559d0574b93d433d6c01d9f77ea4c420519/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-59874.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/35f8822ad3b850cb8a922d9066b0d79c83dab6d5/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-59874.md","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/ae03a9d5bcdec0092d3f179316a97b5f3dabc853/vex/cve/2026/CVE-2026-59874.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/ae03a9d5bcdec0092d3f179316a97b5f3dabc853/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-59874.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37be0559d0574b93d433d6c01d9f77ea4c420519/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-59874.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/77c1c4e2b164ba912ebd6005200ea105caf493c9/reports/2026-07-08/TIER_3_CVE-2026-59874.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/db96a5d12e1a4bc3df59241db4f4f41371d4bdc0/npm/tar/CVE-2026-59874.yml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0843.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0842","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0842.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-59873","title":"node-tar 解压缩拒绝服务漏洞","description":"node-tar 是 Node.js 的 tar 归档操作库，其解压和解析路径（如 src/extract.ts）未对解压后数据总量、条目数量及压缩比设置硬性上限。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过构造特制的极小 Gzip Bomb 压缩包，利用该缺陷在解压时迅速膨胀至数 GB 数据，耗尽服务器磁盘空间和 CPU 资源，导致服务崩溃。该漏洞影响所有使用 node-tar 处理不可信归档的应用（如 npm 注册表、CI/CD 流水线、文件共享平台），CVSS 评分 9.2，危害等级严重。开发者应升级至 7.5.19 及以上版本修复。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.2,"aliases":["CVE-2026-59873","GHSA-23hp-3jrh-7fpw"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-08T16:16:33Z","updated":"2026-07-10T18:57:17Z","remediation":"立即将 node-tar 升级至 7.5.19 或更高版本（`npm install tar@^7.5.19`）。如无法升级，在调用 tar.extract() 前自行校验压缩比，拒绝解压后大小超过阈值（如 1GB）的归档文件，或使用沙箱环境限制磁盘写入配额。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/isaacs/node-tar/commit/2812e9338665659b183aa7226518c307044957d3","https://github.com/isaacs/node-tar/releases/tag/v7.5.19","https://github.com/isaacs/node-tar/security/advisories/GHSA-23hp-3jrh-7fpw","https://github.com/jasonkneen/tiny-world-builder/blob/2383779767430bc3125bd5f8fd2be8ff6e82c9d7/plans/production-line/drafts/2026-07-27T11-24-cve-2026-59873-security-vulnerability-106.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a14f4e66db68a75a9270d6c9081e9ffb7f931cd8/cves/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59873.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/b8f3faf694c27edd208769ff59c4ed562dd91eaa/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59873.json","https://github.com/hoppscotch/hoppscotch/blob/1acb8a3a7581e4db32ba0d529170c4669a2e1053/prod.Dockerfile","https://github.com/cypress-io/cypress/blob/32637845f18d1b02f95c3d7cdaf2b44843e5e791/cli/CHANGELOG.md","https://github.com/appsmithorg/appsmith/blob/ec663b768868dbed5d63f6cd096c2360a68f080c/deploy/docker/base.dockerfile","https://github.com/prowler-cloud/prowler/blob/e15f6970eff8c7245616a46c0cdcd18b4a7fff83/ui/Dockerfile","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3eab0e512529a79daadefaadf0f05372813e7876/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-59873.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/35f8822ad3b850cb8a922d9066b0d79c83dab6d5/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-59873.md","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/ae03a9d5bcdec0092d3f179316a97b5f3dabc853/vex/cve/2026/CVE-2026-59873.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0842.toml"}]